This drawer contains documentation for the AmigaPython distribution.

  AmigaPython.guide     Amiga port guide (start here)
  DiveIntoPython/       Dive Into Python tutorial (AmigaGuide, GFDL)
  Amiga/                Amiga-specific module notes (reST)
  NEWS                  Summary of changes since Python 2.0
  CHANGES               Amiga port change history
  DISCL_and_COPYRIGHT   Disclaimer and licenses
  cheatsheet            Quick command notes
  LICENSE               Python license text
  unicode.txt           Unicode notes

Amiga/ uses the same reStructuredText conventions as the Python 2.7
Library Reference.  See Amiga/readme for the document index.

Full language/library docs: https://docs.python.org/2.7/
